          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Human sperm cells contain lysosomal enzymes. When a sperm meets an egg, these enzymes help break down the outer layer of the egg, allowing fertilisation to take place. You will learn about the human sperm cells later in Chapter 11."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
